// Granular Cloud — Textures and Ambient — from Synth Templates card granular-cloud (schema synth-template-card/0.2)
// Generated by card-to-pdl.py: card words → vocabulary.yaml numbers → VCV Fundamental knobs. Do not edit; edit the card.
# voices: 6

@OSC1 = VCO
@AMP = VCA
@AENV = ADSR
@LFO1 = LFO

// ── Signal flow ──
OSC1:TRI -> AMP:IN
AMP:OUT -> OUT:IN1    // fx skipped
AMP:OUT -> OUT:IN2

// ── Modulation ──
LFO1:SQR -> AMP:CV
KEYBOARD:PITCH -> OSC1:V/OCT
KEYBOARD:GATE -> AENV:GATE

// ── Parameters ──
* OSC1: FREQ = 0
* AMP: LEVEL = 0.5 | RESPONSE = 1.0
* AENV: A = 0.786 | D = 0.571 | S = 0.7 | R = 0.805
* LFO1: FREQ = 3.585 | OFFSET = 0.0

// ── Not carried into PDL ──
// block osc1: unison stack (unison: 7)
// block osc1: unison detune (detune: very wide)
// block fx: fx chain (reverb)
// block lfo2: s&h LFO (LFO has sine, triangle, saw, square outputs)
// audio ['amp', 'fx']: edge through fx (no fx module; the voice goes straight out)
// route lfo2 → osc1.pitch: route from an unmapped block (lfo2)
// route aenv → amp.level: input conflict (one cable per jack) (input AMP:CV already taken by lfo1)
// route wheel → lfo2.depth: route to an unmapped block (lfo2)
